# Property lists always check out with LF, on every platform.
#
# codesign parses the entitlements plist with a stricter reader than plutil,
# and rejects CRLF line endings with "AMFIUnserializeXML: syntax error near
# line 1". A Windows checkout writes CRLF by default, and this repository lives
# on a drive shared with the Mac, so without this rule every Mac build after a
# Windows checkout fails at the signing step. plutil -lint passes the CRLF file,
# which is what makes the failure confusing.
*.plist text eol=lf
